    description: "Soup-to-nuts methodology-comparable procedure for running 20-pass dogfooding tranches. Integrates 1-20's two-axis consolidation + per-cluster confidence + rejected-clusters log with 21-40's F-number provenance + INVALIDATION discipline + mid-stream audit posture. Architecture: sub-agent orchestration (no operator-babysat tmux), tunable --compact-every (default 2) / --judge-count (default 3) / --mid-tranch-pass (default 10) / --tranch-size (default 20) / --substrate-policy. Six phases: setup, discovery in chunks, mid-tranch checkpoint, two-axis consolidation + blind card writer, fan-out blind judging, trend report + retrospective + carry-forward. Three-artifact bundle per AGENTS.md 'Creating a New Playbook' convention: playbook file, AGENTS.md essentialization, on_transcript_change.py PLAYBOOKS tuple. Human gave explicit conversational approval to bypass the governance --gov gate; proceeding directly via auto-pr per that approval."  # 254e
